      "lines": [
        "例3 解方程",
        "$\\operatorname{tg}x=\\sqrt{3}$。",
        "根据(2)式得：",
        "$x=\\operatorname{arctg}\\sqrt{3}+\\pi n,\\quad n\\in\\mathbf{Z}$，",
        "$x=\\frac{\\pi}{3}+\\pi n,\\quad n\\in\\mathbf{Z}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例4 解方程",
        "$\\operatorname{tg}x=5.177$。",
        "根据(2)式得：",
        "$x=\\operatorname{arctg}5.177+\\pi k,\\ x\\approx1.38+\\pi k,\\ k\\in\\mathbf{Z}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "现在列出正切的基本性质。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1. 函数的定义域是除去$\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\pi n$（其中$n\\in\\mathbf{Z}$）这种形式的",
        "数以外所有实数集合。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "2. 正切函数值的集合是整个数轴：$E(\\operatorname{tg})=\\mathbf{R}$。因此，",
        "正切是无界函数。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "3. 正切是奇函数：对于所有的$x\\in D(\\operatorname{tg})$，$\\operatorname{tg}(-x)=↵-\\operatorname{tg}x$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "4. 正切是具有最小正周期$\\pi$的周期函数；对于所有的",
        "$x\\in D(\\operatorname{tg})$，$\\operatorname{tg}(x+\\pi)=\\operatorname{tg}x$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "5. 对于所有的$x=\\pi n(n\\in\\mathbf{Z})$，$\\operatorname{tg}x=0$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "6. 对于所有的$x\\in]\\pi n,\\ \\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\pi n[\\ (n\\in\\mathbf{Z})$，$\\operatorname{tg}x>0$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "7. 对于所有的$x\\in]-\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\pi n,\\ \\pi n[\\ (n\\in\\mathbf{Z})$，$\\operatorname{tg}x<0$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "8. 对于所有的$x\\in D(\\operatorname{tg})$，函数$\\operatorname{tg}$连续并且有导数："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
